TI  - Stochastic error propagation with independent probability distributions in LCA does not preserve mass balances and leads to unusable product compositions—a first quantification
JO  - International Journal of Life Cycle Assessment
A1  - Marsh, Ellen
A1  - Hattam, Laura
A1  - Allen, Stephen
